  "changes": [
    "Created the standalone GPL-3.0-or-later self-amdgpu-runtime repository with an auditable initial baseline commit and annotated project baseline tag.",
    "Established a versioned C ABI and CMake package baseline with static and shared library consumers while deliberately excluding unimplemented GPU transport behavior.",
    "Added a historically anchored, append-only PROJECT_LANES registry that separates project-authored baselines from immutable upstream source provenance and evolving checkpoint heads.",
    "Generalized offline workspace verification, source absorption, commit progression, and two-phase recovery to the exact union of upstream and project-authored lanes.",
    "Advanced the sole next action to the shared runtime-to-gem5 versioned transport handshake."
  ],
